<title>UK: Man Utd slips on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Man Utd slips on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Manchester United Plc slipped on profit-taking on Wednesday, after having won the English Premier soccer league championship, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares finished 21p lower at 640.</p>
<p>&quot;We've seen a bit of profit-taking, and we may see a bit more in the next few months,&quot; one dealer said. &quot;They've won the championship. There's nothing more to go for over the short-term.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
